# Stingerquill Charm, "Choose one": a refusal of two modes at once (Modes(1; 2)) beside the single mode that is chosen,
# the first, "deals 3 damage to any target", here a player: Bot2 goes from 20 to 17 (CR 120.3a).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Stingerquill Charm
Mountain x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
